([{<ro BOI> mo KU} {ge <cu (=C2=B9mo VAU=C2=B9)> <gi (=C2=B9CU [mo VAU]=C2=
=B9)> GIhI}] IAU)=20

You did then said "ja'o lo guskanbau cu banzu frica lo jbobau", which=20
implies that you expelled me from so-called Lojbanistan.

You didn't mention that your parser for your course "camxes-exp" parses=20
cmevla as tanru unit: it is already backward incompatible to camxes. It is=
=20
another evidence of your double standard.

